    <fullName>Normalized_Domain__c</fullName>
    <description>BR-03. Registrable domain normalized from Website, mirroring the Lead Flow normalization exactly so the two are comparable. Formula: zero storage, always current, SOQL-filterable.</description>
    <externalId>false</externalId>
